committed_caps = "Domain 9, services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/read/committed.rs: issue the proof-owned current verification achievement for CommittedCaps and CommittedCall instead of retired CHECKPOINT_FINALISED; fixtures cannot alter the private CommittedCaps type or its unconditional level method."

