refusal_repair = "The old settlement entry required module 1 and kernel transfer legs, omitted Destruction entirely and restored call-bound approval records through a legacy carrier API that explicitly refuses them. native_settlement consumes the current approval producer, authenticates receipts against its retained receipt-key ranges and verifies the precompile logs, held fee preference/root, exact signed bytes and reservation/debit identity. No success assertion is replaced by a refusal."
evidence = "The final matching rows in /out/run/gates.jsonl are the evidence record by reference: exact candidate revision, command, exit and private /out/logs/build-*.log or /out/logs/verify-*.log. hf-build also records its configured dependent-crate qualification. No source or task-record change follows the final hf-build/hf-done pair."

